            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ariko ntutinye weho Yakobo mugaragu wanjye, kandi ntukuke n'umutima Isirayeli we. Kuko nzagukiza ngukuye kure, n'urubyaro rwawe ndukure mu gihugu barimo ari imbohe, Yakobo na we azagaruka abe amahoro kandi agubwe neza, nta wuzamutera ubwoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntutinye Yakobo we, mugaragu wanjye, ni ko Uwiteka avuga, kuko ndi kumwe namwe kandi nzatsembaho rwose amahanga yose nari narakwirukaniyemo, ariko weho sinzagutsembaho rwose nzaguhana uko bikwiriye, ariko ntabwo nzareka kuguhana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.28"
            ]
          }
        }
